Reply with only a single line of compact JSON and nothing else, in exactly this shape:
{"file": "notebook_page_7.txt", "type": "plain text", "status": "copied verbatim", "encoding": "utf-8", "names": ["A", "B", "C", "D", "E"]}
Keep the first four key-value pairs exactly as shown. In the "names" array, replace the placeholder letters with the five real names from the puzzle, in the order the puzzle asks for (the array order is the answer, starting with whoever the puzzle wants listed at the start). Each name appears exactly once. Do not add any other keys, words, comments or text before or after the JSON. Do not use comparison or ranking words anywhere and do not repeat any clue.
